"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1056","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[73,41,63,65,63,71],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"100","reputation":"4300","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001505","helmet":"WP1019505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[73,41,63,65,63,71],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"4300","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001505","helmet":"WP1019505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[73,41,63,65,63,71],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3700","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001505","helmet":"WP1019505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10020","city":"CS1053","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[73,41,63,65,63,71],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"3700","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1001505","helmet":"WP1019505"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"东吴将领，周瑜之侄。依靠叔父周瑜大破曹操、开拓荆州的功绩受吴主孙权提拔官拜偏将军，统辖官兵千余人。曾受大都督陆逊调遣，陆逊假意驻营打猎以作掩护，暗中派周峻与张梁一同率军突袭曹魏江夏郡新市、安陆、石阳，大军突至令当地百姓慌乱丢弃财物逃入城内。周峻育有一子周护。","tc":"東吳將領，周瑜之侄。依靠叔父周瑜大破曹操、開拓荊州的功績受吳主孫權提拔官拜偏將軍，統轄官兵千余人。曾受大都督陸遜調遣，陸遜假意駐營打獵以作掩護，暗中派周峻與張梁一同率軍突襲曹魏江夏郡新市、安陸、石陽，大軍突至令當地百姓慌亂丟棄財物逃入城內。周峻育有一子周護。","en":"An Eastern Wu officer and nephew of Zhou Yu. Promoted by Sun Quan to Lieutenant on the merit of his uncle Zhou Yu, who had crushed Cao Cao and expanded into Jing Province, he commanded over a thousand troops. He was once dispatched under the orders of Minister Lu Xun. Using an encampment hunt as a cover, Lu Xun secretly sent Zhou Jun and Zhang Liang to lead troops in a surprise raid on Xinshi, Anlu, and Shiyang in Cao Wei's Jiangxia Commandery. The sudden arrival of the army threw the local civilians into panic, forcing them to abandon their belongings and flee into the city. Zhou Jun had a son named Zhou Hu.","jp":"東呉の将。周瑜の甥。叔父の周瑜が曹操を大破して荊州を開拓した功績により、呉主・孫権に抜擢されて偏将軍に任じられ、千余りの官兵を統率した。かつて大都督・陸遜の命を受け、陸遜が狩猟を名目に陣営に留まり陽動する間に、張梁と共に密かに軍を率いて曹魏の江夏郡新市・安陸・石陽を急襲した。大軍の急襲を受けた現地の民衆は慌てふためき、財物を投げ捨てて城内へと逃げ込んだ。子に周護がいる。","kr":"동오의 장수이자 주유의 조카이다. 숙부 주유가 조조를 대파하고 형주를 개척한 공적 덕분에 오주 손권에게 발탁되어 편장군에 배수되었으며, 관병 1천여 명을 통솔했다. 한때 대도독 육손의 지휘를 받기도 했는데, 육손이 진영에 머물며 사냥하는 척 엄호하는 사이 은밀히 주준과 장량을 파견해 조위 강하군의 신시, 안륙, 석양을 기습하게 하니, 대군이 갑자기 들이닥치자 현지 백성들은 당황하여 재물을 버려둔 채 성안으로 달아났다. 슬하에 아들 주호를 두었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1045715","remark":"普武","surname":"周","surnameTc":"周","surnameEn":"Zhou","surnameJp":"周","surnameKr":"주","surnameOther":"","name":"峻","nameTc":"峻","nameEn":"Jun","nameJp":"峻","nameKr":"준","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"周峻","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"219","city":"CS1053","gender":"0","rule":"73","force":"41","wise":"63","politics":"65","charm":"63","will":"71","ruleTalent":"9","forceTalent":"3","wiseTalent":"10","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"19/25/41/19/20/23/24/16","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"2700","battleSoulPoint":"4000","debateSoulPoint":"6400","strategy":"","strategy2":"1001905","professions":"0/0/0/1/0/3/3/1/2/2/1/1/1/2/2/1/1/1/2/1/0/1/2/1","att